  "originalQuery": "Your company has a set of resources hosted in AWS.\nYour IT Supervisor is concerned with the costs incurred by the resources running in AWS and wants to optimize the costs as much as possible.\nWhich of the following ways could help achieve this efficiently? Choose 2 answers from the options given below.",
